##! Please refer to the documentation at
##! https://coreruleset.org/docs/development/regex_assembly/.

##! Detect Unix shell history invocation / bash negation pattern (!-d)

##!+ i

##! Anchor to end of string or require command suffix
##!$ (?:$|[\s<>&|),]|!-)

##! Look word characters at the start (cat!-3), or check for a non-word character before history invokation.
##!^ (?:^\w*|\W)

!-\d{1,3}
